r Tessa back to the ice. As she descends, he transitions smoothly into a forward glide, with Tessa now skating alongside him. He extends his left arm out to the side, and she mirrors his movement, creating a dynamic, flowing transition from the lift into the next sequence of their routine.\n\nThis opening lift is a powerful and visually stunning way to begin their performance, immediately capturing the audience\'s attention and setting the tone for the elegance and athleticism that will follow.'}], 'formatted_responses': ['\n=== Batch 0-15 (15 frames) ===\nFrames: /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1430.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1435.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1440.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1445.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1450.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1455.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1460.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1465.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1470.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1475.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1480.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1485.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1490.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1495.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1500.jpg\nVLM Response: Based on the provided frames, the very first move Tessa Virtue and Scott Moir perform to begin their ice dance routine is a **dramatic, synchronized lift**.\n\nHere is a detailed description of the opening move:\n\n1.  **Starting Position (Frame 2 & 3):** The routine begins with Tessa and Scott standing still, facing each other in the center of the ice. They are in a close, intimate embrace, with Scott\'s arms around Tessa\'s waist and Tessa\'s arms around Scott\'s neck. They are looking into each other\'s eyes, creating a moment of stillness and anticipation before the music starts. The "SOCHI 2014" branding is visible in the background.\n\n2.  **Initiation of the Move (Frame 5):** The routine is initiated by Scott. He begins to lift Tessa, who is already positioned with her back to him. She kicks her right leg up high behind her as he lifts her off the ice. Her left leg remains extended forward, and her arms are outstretched to the sides for balance and expression. Scott\'s posture is strong and grounded as he supports her weight.\n\n3.  **Execution of the Lift (Frame 6 & 7):** Scott fully lifts Tessa into the air. She extends her left leg high and back, almost parallel to the ice, while her right leg is bent at the knee. Her arms are raised gracefully above her head, creating a beautiful, flowing line. Scott holds her securely around the waist and hip, his body slightly bent to maintain balance. This is a classic ice dance lift, showcasing both strength and elegance.\n\n4.  **Transition (Frame 8 & 9):** Scott begins to lower Tessa back to the ice. As she descends, he transitions smoothly into a forward glide, with Tessa now skating alongside him. He extends his left arm out to the side, and she mirrors his movement, creating a dynamic, flowing transition from the lift into the next sequence of their routine.\n\nThis opening lift is a powerful and visually stunning way to begin their performance, immediately capturing the audience\'s attention and setting the tone for the elegance and athleticism that will follow.\n'], 'condensed_response': '**Scene Summary (Frames\u202f1430‑1500)**  \n\n- **Frames\u202f1430‑1435 (Frames\u202f2‑3)** – Tessa Virtue and Scott\u202fMoir stand face‑to‑face at the centre of the ice, arms entwined in an intimate embrace. Their eyes mee