ditionally, the performance is identified as a **competitive free program**, not a **gala/exhibition**, which further invalidates the premise of the question as framed.\n\n✅ **Final Answer: No, '3' is not correct.**"}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 60, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1455.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1456.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1457.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1458.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1459.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1460.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1461.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1462.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1463.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1464.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1465.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1466.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1467.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1468.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1469.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1470.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1471.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1472.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1473.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1474.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1475.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_1476.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/fram